 "port_lessons": [
  "Peeling the last K block outside the dynamic loop let LLVM sink its dequant FMAs past the epilogue barrier: 256 VGPR + 50 spilled. Running every block in the loop with clamped next-block indices gives 242 VGPR, 0 scratch.",
  "small rmem fill(0) broke fly-layout-lowering without diagnostics; explicit Vec.filled stores compile.",
  "A sched_barrier only after each {MFMA, FMA} pair let LLVM place the FMA before its MFMA, one MFMA after the producer; XDL hazards forced s_nop 4 and ATT showed 2.29% VALU stall (MFMA busy 90.97% vs PyHIP 93.82%). A second sched_barrier between MFMA and FMA restores strict alternation (gap 0.3-1.6% to PyHIP).",
  "B scales use inline s_buffer_load_dword (the tracked SMEM intrinsic gets conservative waits, as in the gfx950 reference); every consumer is behind lgkmcnt(0), verified by the ISA wait audit."
 ],
